  "text_md": "![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nSpecSeal\n\nSSP\n\n# SSP Putty & Putty Pads\n\nSpecSeal ® SSP Firestop Putty excels at sealing cabling penetrations and outlet boxes. SSP Putty is non-hardening and easily hand works around grouped cabling penetrations forming a re-enterable seal allowing for future work. When applied to outlet boxes, SSP Putty easily works into voids and seams forming a continuous seal against fire, smoke, and hot gases.\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n# Features & Benefits\n\n- • Available in bars or preformed pads\n- • Remains pliable and workable for the lifetime of the installation\n- • Acoustically tested\n- • Will not harden over time\n\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\nINTUMESCENT\n\nFIRESTOP\n\nPUTTY\n\n# ORDERING INFORMATION\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Catalog Number UPC</th>\n    <th>Number</th>\n    <th>Size</th>\n    <th>(EOM)</th>\n    <th>Qty. Case Qty.</th>\n    <th>Weight (Each)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>SSP100</td>\n    <td>730573021057</td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>2.22 lbs (1.01 kg)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>SSP28</td>\n    <td>730573021019</td>\n    <td>24 in 3 (0.4 liter) bar</td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>1.42 lbs (0.64 kg)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>SSP4S</td>\n    <td>73057302200</td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>1 20</td>\n    <td>0.64 lbs (0.29 kg)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>SSP9S</td>\n    <td>73057302300</td>\n    <td>9.00\" x 9.00 x 3/16\" (229 mm x 229 mm x 4.8 mm) pad</td>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>1 20</td>\n    <td>0.85 lbs (0.39 kg)</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile10.png>)\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile7.png>)\n\nACOUSTICAL\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile8.png>)\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile9.png>)\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile5.png>)\n\nGoor\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile6.png>)\n\nTEST STANDARDS:   ASTM E814 (UL 1479), CAN/ULC-S115, UL263\n\nFM\n\nAPPROVED\n\nIntertek\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile4.png>)\n\nSTI\n\nInc:\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile13.png>)\n\nIFC\n\nMEMBER\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile11.png>)\n\nSpecSeal'\n\nSSP\n\nClick here to learn more about\n\n",
